i, una studentessa universitaria di Tokyo, visita Kumamoto in cerca di amici che non è riuscita a contattare in seguito ai terremoti di Kumamoto. Lì incontra persone del posto piene di compassione e unicità, tra cui l'energica studentessa delle scuole medie, Izumi. Inizia una sincera storia di formazione."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Natsunagu!","overview":"Natsuna Kunugi, a university student in Tokyo, visits Kumamoto in search of friends who she could not contact following the Kumamoto earthquakes. There, she meets local people who are full of compassion and uniqueness, including the energetic junior high school student, Izumi. A heartfelt coming-of-age story begins."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"東京在住の女子大学生\"欅 夏奈\"は 熊本在住の友人\"itsuki（いつき）\"とオンラインゲームを通じて親しくしていたが、熊本の震災を機に連絡が疎遠になってしまっていた。\n\nしばしの時が流れた或る日、突然\"itsuki\"から「会いたい」とだけ書いたメールが来たことを機に、震災から復興のさなかにある熊本を訪れる。\n\n本作は2016年に発生した熊本地震の復興プロモーションとして熊本県が制作する。メインスタッフやメインキャストは熊本県出身者が起用され、熊本県を舞台とした制作プロジェクト「オール熊本アニメ」を立ち上げることになった。(Wikipediaより)"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oit7fDhDcMArQ8BdFhmtiNCGmQa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oit7fDhDcMArQ8BdFhmtiNCGmQa.jpg","language":"ja","width":1448,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bXFZdH95Kf4EjySkxr0H0BayJ0M.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bXFZdH95Kf4EjySkxr0H0BayJ0M.jpg","language":"ja","width":1448,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Na0UZaY9aE4zxHh6lt1EeR62Kb.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6Na0UZaY9aE4zxHh6lt1EeR62Kb.jpg","language":"xx","width":640,"height":905},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2XrGmsjlBiMLtjglwvTc6bpLexa.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2XrGmsjlBiMLtjglwvTc6bpLexa.jpg","language":"xx","width":1047,"height":1480}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fAXxNQmhf3Gn0F2BwXtsXtJiT